     5	## 2026-11-05 — v2.12.5: a sharper advisory diff review, measured first (contract v2.11)
     6	
     7	- **`glm-diff-review` (new):** an advisory review of a finished change. It adds four fixed questions (existing data,
     8	  claims, untested behaviour, failure paths), asks for every suspect with a confidence, and gives no overall verdict.
