    70	PR was refused. Each merged PR adds reports, so once an anchor slid out of the
    71	window it never came back. A gate run with `--base origin/main` was not
    72	affected. The cap failed closed, so this was a liveness bug, not a fail-open.
    73	The same cap also broke a repo with no L3 at all: with more than 100 honest L1
    74	reports, the oldest one in the window had to cover a 10+-file segment, which
    75	is L2 by breadth, so the chain never validated.
