   108	  runs without one. `git rev-list` still lists the whole history before the
   109	  walk starts. A history too large to list inside git's 30 s timeout makes
   110	  the floor unknowable and the gate refuses, which is fail-closed.
   111	
   112	**Known limits, unchanged by this release:** the walk evaluates historical
   113	reports with the default human gate, so an L3 report that passed under
